      "message": "Looking below, the details are `export_tombstones` and `payload_binary_path`. I think both of these deserve to be called out explicitly rather than hidden behind a hash.\n\n`export_tombstones` is of interest to clients that want to know whether the VM might leak data in tombstones.\n\n`payload_binary_path` is needed by clients to be able to tell what of the VM package is actually executing in the. VM. (Unless we have a fixed entry point, but that might be too restrictive). (Are so paths the interface that\u0027s exposed to clients?).\n\nThat said, we already didn\u0027t have this and wouldn\u0027t use it until attestation.",
